39
00:08:20,708 --> 00:08:24,788
命の リミット 心臓が カウントしてる
The limit of life begins, my heartbeat is counting down.

40
00:08:24,788 --> 00:08:27,708
心臓が カウントしてる
My heartbeat is counting down.

41
00:08:27,788 --> 00:08:35,788
叶えても 叶えても 終わらない願い
Even if it comes true, even if it comes true, an endless wish.

42
