00:45:07,564 --> 00:45:12,424
なかなかね、こんなにホロメンが集まることってないので、もう本当生誕祭！大祭りって感じで嬉しいです！
It's pretty rare for so many Holomembers to gather like this, so it really feels like a birthday celebration and a huge festival! I'm so happy!

